        "text": "You are reading a photo or scan of a receipt. Return ONLY valid JSON, no extra text, in exactly this shape:\n\n{\n  \"merchant\": \"store or business name\",\n  \"receipt_date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"total\": 0.00,\n  \"tax\": 0.00,\n  \"category\": \"Meals | Office Supplies | Fuel/Transport | Utilities | Software | Marketing | Other\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- total is the final amount paid, including tax and tip.\n- If a value cannot be read clearly, use null. Do not guess.\n- Dates must be YYYY-MM-DD.",
