        "text": "=You are a bookkeeping assistant for a small business owner. Write a short, friendly weekly spending summary (plain text, max 100 words) from the data below. Mention the biggest category and one practical observation. If receipts need review, remind the owner to check them. Output only the email body, no subject line. Do not invent numbers.\n\nPeriod: {{ $json.period }}\nReceipts: {{ $json.count }}\nTotal spent: {{ $json.total }}\nBy category:\n{{ $json.categories }}\nBiggest expense: {{ $json.biggest }}\nReceipts needing review: {{ $json.needsReview }}",
